ed Languages), and since it's ONE line of code, this pull is trivial and there shouldn't really be any reason not to pull this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657357233/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657368904","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102787#issuecomment-2657368904","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102787","id":2657368904,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eZDtI","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-13T18:06:23Z","updated_at":"2025-02-13T18:06:23Z","body":"I think we should either add all (with relevant UI changes at the same time) or only ones being explicitly demanded by the community, not making decisions on conlangs based on theoretical demand (assuming all in-use natural languages have been added of course)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657368904/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657372495","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102787#issuecomment-2657372495","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102787","id":2657372495,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eZElP","user":{"login":"EGAMatsu","id":58616438,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjE2NDM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58616438?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EGAMatsu","html_url":"https://github.com/EGAMatsu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EGAMatsu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EGAMatsu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EGAMatsu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EGAMatsu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EGAMatsu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EGAMatsu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EGAMatsu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EGAMatsu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EGAMatsu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-13T18:08:06Z","updated_at":"2025-02-13T18:08:06Z","body":"> I think we should either add all (with relevant UI changes at the same time) or only ones being explicitly demanded by the community, not making decisions on conlangs based on theoretical demand (assuming all in-use natural languages have been added of course)\r\n\r\nIt's also (Unless I should add more to make the pull more worthwile since it seems you don't want to pull it because of how small of a change it is to the codebase) a very small change to make it so the people (Like I myself) who are currently dealing with the language in the Engine can properly see the name, instead of it being blank in the GUI.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657372495/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657379439","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102787#issuecomment-2657379439","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102787","id":2657379439,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eZGRv","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-13T18:11:26Z","updated_at":"2025-02-13T18:19:07Z","body":"We don't oppose small PRs that are valid or in demand, but adding changes that we have no reason to expect to be used, I think you misunderstood what I was saying, namely, either:\r\n* Add this (and any other cases that have been demanded by users, in a proposal or discussion)\r\n* Improve the UI and then add all of the ISO set of languages\r\n\r\nI'm unsure what the entire need for this is, i.e. if it is needed to be explicit, or if the interface allows adding custom entries as desired, and what the list in the editor is used for in practice, if it is used to fetch from translation features, the OS etc.\r\n\r\nEdit: I think you're either misunderstanding what I'm saying, or arguing against a point someone else has made elsehwere, I'm not doubting or questioning the demand for this, or that this is outlandish or anything, I've not once \"argue[d] about stuff being too small\", so please check what I'm saying again","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657379439/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657389712","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102787#issuecomment-2657389712","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102787","id":2657389712,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eZIyQ","user":{"login":"EGAMatsu","id":58616438,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjE2NDM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58616438?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EGAMatsu","html_url":"https://github.com/EGAMatsu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EGAMatsu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EGAMatsu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EGAMatsu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EGAMatsu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EGAMatsu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EGAMatsu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EGAMatsu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EGAMatsu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EGAMatsu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-13T18:15:47Z","updated_at":"2025-02-13T18:15:47Z","body":"> We don't oppose small PRs that are valid or in demand, but adding changes that we have no reason to expect to be used, I think you misunderstood what I was saying, namely, either:\r\n> \r\n> * Add this (and any other cases that have been demanded by users, in a proposal or discussion)\r\n> * Improve the UI and then add all of the ISO set of languages\r\n\r\nThere is a small community that could use this feature, especially since a good chunk of the community that makes games in Toki Pona, use Godot, I am translating a game (Uncanny Cat Golf) to the language, and the fact the name doesn't show is annoying and throws me off when every other Language shows.\r\n\r\nThe Language itself is big enough that YouTube lets you subtitle (And translate titles/descriptions) to Toki Pona, and some games, most notably Minecraft recently added support for the language, and if you want to argue about stuff being too small, I think Minecraft adding support for the language in the base game (no mods or anything) should be enough to show that enough people use the language, that adding it to the menu wouldn't be that outlandish of a move.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657389712/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657390431","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102787#issuecomment-2657390431","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102787","id":2657390431,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eZI9f","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-13T18:16:07Z","updated_at":"2025-02-13T18:17:50Z","body":"> I could possibly go through the languages and add a few more of the newer languages to make the pull more worthwile, since adding everything new would be too extreme of a change, though at the very least\r\n\r\nIt's not extreme, it's the only reasonable thing to do, but since there are no real issues (any code can be used and editor UI issues with the current are fixed), it's not a priority and will take some time.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657390431/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657399501","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/